<dictionary>
  <!-- This file makes heavy use of bidix pardefs, eg. to change from
       sme PoS tags to nob PoS tags, to mark certain sme verbs as
       inherently passive/causative/reflexive (which again triggers
       certain transfer rules), etc.

See https://wiki.apertium.org/wiki/Northern_Sámi_and_Norwegian/bidix
for more information.
  -->

  <!-- There are some comments like "todo check" in this file where my
dictionary didn't have the answers, feel free to improve... - KBU -->
